{"projectInfo":{"name":"VRRP负载均衡模式配置举例","path":"vrrp_ipv4_balance","visibility":2,"categoryId":48,"introduction":"Router A、Router B和Router C属于虚拟IP地址为10.1.1.1/24的备份组1；10.1.1.0/24网段内主机的缺省网关为10.1.1.1/24，利用VRRP备份组保证某台网关设备（Router A、Router B或Router C）出现故障时，局域网内的主机仍然可以通过网关访问外部网络；备份组1工作在负载均衡模式，通过一个备份组实现负载分担，充分利用网关资源；在Router A、Router B和Router C上分别配置虚拟转发器通过Track项监视上行接口GigabitEthernet0/0的状态。当上行接口出现故障时，降低Router A、Router B或Router C上虚拟转发器的权重，以便其它设备接管它的转发任务。","label":["VRRP"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Network","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Network.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host-C","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-C.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW.cfg"}]}